# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile.server. An allowlist: everything else
# (.git, node_modules, the frontend, .env-files/ and every other local
# secret) never reaches the Docker daemon, let alone a layer.
*
!apps/backend/
!config/
!workflows/
!capabilities/
!skills/
!.agents/
!SOUL.md
!deploy/server-entrypoint.sh

# Inside the allowed trees: local state, caches and secrets.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
apps/backend/data/
